<title>UK: Itochu Corp sets 10 bln yen Feb 2002 FRN.</title>
<headline>Itochu Corp sets 10 bln yen Feb 2002 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Norinchukin International Plc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ITOCHU CORP</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    BASE	*6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    20.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *50	  PAY DATE  S-20.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  100.0     FULL FEES   25 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (M) 100	 GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON OF 2-MONTH LIBOR +50 BP</p>
<p>		*CAPPED TO 1.25 PCT TO FEB 1998, 1.70 PCT TO FEB</p>
<p>		 1999, 2.10 PCT TO FEB 2000, 2.40 PCT TO FEB 2001</p>
<p>		 AND 3.0 PCT TO MATURITY</p>
<p>		 ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
